# Copy to ~/.config/agent-sandbox/deny-paths and adapt.
# Host paths that are never mounted or copied into the sandbox, in addition to
# the built-in rules (your home directory as a whole, every hidden entry
# directly in it, /proc, /sys, /dev, /run, /boot, this repository, the config
# directory and the data directory).
# A path is refused if it lies inside one of these or contains one of them.
~/Documents/private
~/sync
/mnt/backup
